        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "85c4be6d-e488-5e62-ad02-e6399effb71a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Harry Morgan\n- TV series: Kentucky Jones, December Bride, Pete and Gladys, Dragnet, Hec Ramsey, M*A*S*H, AfterMASH\n- Roles: Seldom Jackson, Pete Porter, Officer Bill Gannon, Amos Coogan, Colonel Sherman T. Potter\n\nFacts:\n- From 1954 to 1959, Harry Morgan played Pete Porter in the TV series \"December Bride.\"\n- From 1960 to 1962, Harry Morgan played Pete Porter in the TV series \"Pete and Gladys.\"\n- In the series \"Kentucky Jones,\" Harry Morgan appeared as Seldom Jackson, a former jockey who assists Dr. Jones.\n- From 1967 to 1970, Harry Morgan played Officer Bill Gannon on \"Dragnet.\"\n- From 1972 to 1974, Harry Morgan played Amos Coogan on \"Hec Ramsey.\"\n- From 1975 to 1983, Harry Morgan starred as Colonel Sherman T. Potter in \"M*A*S*H.\"\n- From 1983 to 1984, Harry Morgan played Colonel Sherman T. Potter in \"AfterMASH.\"",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "c725caee-4415-59be-b912-49690b2e42e3",
        "text": "Page: Kentucky Jones. Sentence: Harry Morgan, previously of the CBS sitcoms \"December Bride\" and \"Pete and Gladys\", was featured in the series as Seldom Jackson, a former jockey who assists Dr. Jones.\nPage: Harry Morgan. Sentence: Morgan's major roles included Pete Porter in both \"December Bride\" (1954–1959) and \"Pete and Gladys\" (1960–1962); Officer Bill Gannon on \"Dragnet\" (1967–1970); Amos Coogan on \"Hec Ramsey\" (1972–1974); and his starring role as Colonel Sherman T. Potter in \"M*A*S*H\" (1975–1983) and \"AfterMASH\" (1983–1984).",
        "type": "DocumentChunk"
      },
